rfaces. Place them wherever your offline audience is likely to engage with your brand.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is QR scanning supported on smartphones?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, QR code scanning is natively supported on modern iOS and Android smartphones. Users simply open their native camera app and point it at the QR graphic to trigger the link. No third-party QR scanner apps are required, ensuring a fast, smooth user experience. This universal support means you can use QR codes confidently across all customer touchpoints.\"}}]}12:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebApplication\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"WhatsApp QR Code Generator\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/social/whatsapp-qr-generator\\\",\\\"applicationCategory\\\":\\\"UtilityApplication\\\",\\\"operatingSystem\\\":\\\"All\\\",\\\"browserRequirements\\\":\\\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Create QR codes that automatically open a WhatsApp chat when scanned.\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1b\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Social Media Tools\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/category/social\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"WhatsApp QR Code Generator\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/social/whatsapp-qr-generator\\\"}]}\"}}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"]\n1f:I[6303,[\"9756\",\"stati